WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0025: movement sync in world mode.
Issues 22/23: wowmobs.bin streams every nearby mob as this frame draws it (position,
orientation, velocity) for BG3's stand-ins: the own body follows BG3's character
frame by frame from the packet pose (wowbg3_body.rs): mobs.txt's hero line ends with
the body's state (alive, dead, ghost).

